<title>SWEDEN: Swedish retail sales rose 2.4 pct yr/yr in Feb.</title>
<headline>Swedish retail sales rose 2.4 pct yr/yr in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish retail sales rose 2.4 percent year on year in February, Statistics Sweden said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    (Percentage change)	   Feb 97     year to date</p>
<p>    Retail sales		    +2.4	 +1.3</p>
<p>    - in non-specialised stores +0.7	 -0.1</p>
<p>    - in specialised stores     +4.7	 +3.1</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
